ovide accurate descriptions, specifications, documentation, and images.<br data-start="1453" data-end="1456" />However, all information is provided <strong data-start="1493" data-end="1504">“as is”</strong> and may be updated without notice.</p><h3 data-start="1541" data-end="1570"><strong data-start="1545" data-end="1570">Feed-Grade Disclaimer</strong></h3><p data-start="1571" data-end="1611">All products listed on this Website are:</p><ul data-start="1613" data-end="1769"><li data-start="1613" data-end="1646"><p data-start="1615" data-end="1646"><strong data-start="1615" data-end="1644">Feed-grade additives only</strong></p></li><li data-start="1647" data-end="1684"><p data-start="1649" data-end="1684"><strong data-start="1649" data-end="1682">For animal nutrition use only</strong></p></li><li data-start="1685" data-end="1769"><p data-start="1687" data-end="1769"><strong data-start="1687" data-end="1769">Not for human consumption, food processing, pharmaceutical use, or medical use</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start="1771" data-end="1858">If you need food-grade or pharmaceutical-grade materials, please contact us separately.</p><p data-start="1860" data-end="1932">Dinweys is not responsible for improper or unauthorized use of products.</p><hr data-start="1934" data-end="1937" /><h1 data-start="1939" data-end="1966"><strong data-start="1941" data-end="1966">4. Orders and Payment</strong></h1><p data-start="1967" data-end="2059">Placing an order constitutes your offer to purchase products. Dinweys reserves the right to:</p><ul data-start="2061" data-end="2167"><li data-start="2061" data-end="2088"><p data-start="2063" data-end="2088">Accept or reject orders</p></li><li data-start="2089" data-end="2124"><p data-start="2091" data-end="2124">Request additional verification</p></li><li data-start="2125" data-end="2167"><p data-start="2127" data-end="2167">Cancel suspicious or incomplete orders</p></li></ul><h3 data-start="2169" data-end="2184"><strong data-start="2173"