ermission.</p><hr data-start="3661" data-end="3664" /><h1 data-start="3666" data-end="3698"><strong data-start="3668" data-end="3698">8. Limitation of Liability</strong></h1><p data-start="3699" data-end="3738">To the fullest extent permitted by law:</p><ul data-start="3740" data-end="4114"><li data-start="3740" data-end="3831"><p data-start="3742" data-end="3831">Dinweys is not liable for <strong data-start="3768" data-end="3828">indirect, incidental, punitive, or consequential damages</strong>.</p></li><li data-start="3832" data-end="3950"><p data-start="3834" data-end="3950">Dinweys is not responsible for losses caused by improper storage, handling, or use of feed additives by the buyer.</p></li><li data-start="3951" data-end="4049"><p data-start="3953" data-end="4049">Our total liability is limited to the <strong data-start="3991" data-end="4024">purchase price of the product</strong> involved in the claim.</p></li><li data-start="4050" data-end="4114"><p data-start="4052" data-end="4114">We do not guarantee uninterrupted availability of the Website.</p></li></ul><hr data-start="4116" data-end="4119" /><h1 data-start="4121" data-end="4163"><strong data-start="4123" data-end="4163">9. Compliance and Export Regulations</strong></h1><p data-start="4164" data-end="4191">Buyers are responsible for:</p><ul data-start="4193" data-end="4400"><li data-start="4193" data-end="4267"><p data-start="4195" data-end="4267">Ensuring imported feed additives comply with the laws of their country</p></li><li data-start="4268" data-end="4338"><p data-start="4270" data-end="4338">Obtaining required permits, import licenses, and customs clearance</p></li><li data-start="4339" data-end="4400"><p data-start="4341" data-end="4400">Using products strictly for approved animal feed purposes</p></li></ul><p data-start="4402" data-end="4481">Dinweys does not assume responsibility for a buyer’s regulatory non-compliance.</p><hr data-start="4483" data-end="4486" /><h1 data-start="4488" data-end